{"curious":"./audio/293028aa6ff9.m4a","tight":"./audio/98b9f3569789.m4a","yard":"./audio/3ce2e832336a.m4a","refrigerator":"./audio/a473593df4b4.m4a","bathing suit":"./audio/092d152e4446.m4a","curtain":"./audio/c8158837c0d3.m4a","ancient":"./audio/9c92ad25076f.m4a","castle":"./audio/36e473c8b75b.m4a","pickles":"./audio/08c406094e33.m4a","electricity":"./audio/3894e2077240.m4a","assignment":"./audio/f26b63d628c9.m4a","turn in":"./audio/540047a3d063.m4a","Hi! What can I get for you today?":"./audio/451e94b00ee0.m4a","I'd like a latte, please.":"./audio/5d9197ce0f68.m4a","Sure. What size would you like?":"./audio/69e9bba5cb84.m4a","A medium, please.":"./audio/37179c478b85.m4a","Would you like anything to eat?":"./audio/23b33a9e8268.m4a","No, thanks. That's all.":"./audio/619cda04595c.m4a","Great! Is that for here or to go?":"./audio/be70075e8ff2.m4a","To go, please.":"./audio/287c8b8d25e7.m4a","Hi, I'm Alex. What's your name?":"./audio/7ab62d51d665.m4a","Hi Alex, I'm ___. Nice to meet you.":"./audio/d70fb94f593b.m4a","Nice to meet you too! Where are you from?":"./audio/2503013eeaa7.m4a","I'm from China. I live in ___.":"./audio/6e2366457272.m4a","Cool! What do you like to do in your free time?":"./audio/57a5e7e3c23d.m4a","I enjoy reading and going for walks.":"./audio/242f5f84eb55.m4a","That sounds fun. What are you learning these days?":"./audio/ff196d878e67.m4a","I'm learning English because I want to travel.":"./audio/a62879e46f90.m4a","Hello! You look a little lost. Can I help you?":"./audio/13edbc1edb31.m4a","Yes, how can I get to the train station?":"./audio/1b6d0571c586.m4a","Of course. Go straight and turn left at the bank.":"./audio/0134b91dc083.m4a","Is it far from here?":"./audio/be50ee372386.m4a","It's about a ten-minute walk.":"./audio/c4bb5c77ab40.m4a","Great. Should I cross the street?":"./audio/8319380a0fe0.m4a","Yes, cross at the traffic light. You'll see it on your right.":"./audio/4012dc370a4d.m4a","Thank you so much for your help!":"./audio/198651e3dcbb.m4a"}